	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Pimento for Alfred: a launcher for the pimento CLI (https://github.com/Melvin2306/pimento). It runs pimento with --json and never talks to Azure or sees a token itself.

pim                       presets, active roles (time left) and eligible roles
pim WORDS                 only those whose names contain every word
↩ on a role               fills in the role; type &gt; and a justification, then ↩ to activate
                          (⌘↩: the maximum its PIM policy allows)
↩ on a preset             activates it with its justification (type &gt; TEXT to use another)
⌥↩ on an active role      deactivates it

Configuration: pimento_path (empty: ~/.local/bin/pimento, then PATH and Homebrew, then Pimento.app), tenant, the default duration, and demo mode (synthetic data, offline).</string>
